            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.stripe.com/v1/disputes/:dispute/close",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "dispute",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "form-urlencoded",
              "data": []
            }
          },
          "docs": "<p>Closing the dispute for a charge indicates that you do not have any evidence to submit and are essentially dismissing the dispute, acknowledging it as lost.</p>\n\n<p>The status of the dispute will change from <code>needs_response</code> to <code>lost</code>. <em>Closing a dispute is irreversible</em>.</p>"
        }
      ]
